          "caption": "Yamdrok Lake (Yamdrok Yutso in Tibetan dialect) is one of the holy or sacred lakes in Tibet. Yamdrok Yutso is purely in turquoise color as the Yutso means “turquoise\" in Tibetan language and the lake was named after that. It can be viewed from the top of the Khambala (pass) on an altitude of 4770m above sea-level.",
